---
<section class="flex flex-col-reverse items-center justify-between gap-10 py-12 sm:flex-row sm:py-32">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center sm:items-start sm:text-left">
        <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--accent)]">
            Software Engineer &middot; Cloud &amp; Security
        </p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-[var(--text-primary)] sm:text-6xl">
            Hi, I'm Aly.
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-[var(--text-secondary)] sm:text-xl">
            Software Engineer in Big Tech building secure, scalable and reliable infrastructure.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 sm:justify-start">
            <a href="#services"
               class="rounded-full bg-[var(--accent)] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--bg-primary)] no-underline transition-opacity hover:opacity-90 hover:no-underline">
                What I build
            </a>
            <a href="#contact"
               class="rounded-full border border-[var(--border-color)] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] no-underline transition-colors hover:border-[var(--accent)] hover:text-[var(--accent)] hover:no-underline">
                Get in touch
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
    <img
        src="/headshot.jpg"
        alt="Aly Elalwany"
        width="160"
        height="160"
        class="h-32 w-32 shrink-0 rounded-full border-2 border-[var(--border-color)] object-cover object-[center_15%] scale-[1.4] sm:h-40 sm:w-40"
    />
</section>
